Text Notes 700 7600 0    60    ~ 0
PLACEMENT: keep all three 680 uF capacitors close to the bridge bus. Fit local 1 uF + 10 nF / 100 V ceramics at each power block.
Text Notes 700 7950 0    60    ~ 0
R102/C107 and D101 are DNP tuning positions. Select only after cable/hot-plug measurements; they are not functional requirements for first power-up.
Text Notes 700 8300 0    60    ~ 0
VBUS_SENSE = VM x 27k/(540k+27k): 2.00 V at 42 V, 2.86 V at 60 V. Set the firmware overvoltage trip below the hardware transient ceiling.
